71146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OSoqIgPXTeUQ7kNvwE1BnD2&_nc_oc=Adq_qfP0TPQ_4SG_4bDHn6N6mhR5B5tKsiWW8U9qGFLrr0Kle3N5K_1pStcb1I4a9-s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFfqpSCy-T45XFPSsA4CVsQCPdg-IN1odo4OVVyb1_YOQ&oe=6A772AB9"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZhU5VFMpQSMQ7kNvwFbWrLM&_nc_oc=Ado_BC92kwU8Cls5iMWLkzpwOGI09Y54dHv4X42TkYDIo8MQHYH5g2dRwFQjUPNdEbY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGrDizJQN-Ib1pnrjW1YSmHB4_ZSzjQ1TfifiHyEH_xuw&oe=6A773D93"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=D70EL6_8Bm8Q7kNvwH3zlK-&_nc_oc=AdrmxhwPQgAFsxHKf-6eoW_sYBS13opUjZgjXOVSJTPvkRuz6BD2eBkM96NzCwFO6hU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEemHCPliW2Zr4_xBYv6oHWOz74h6MBfbvOE9-8rHbWNQ&oe=6A773BDA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https: